Package: cellreportR
Title: Cell Culture Microscopy Assay Analysis and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides a complete pipeline for analyzing cell culture-based
    laboratory assays evaluated by microscopy. Starting from segmented
    single-cell data (e.g. from 'segmantR'), the package handles
    experimental design specification, fluorescence intensity
    quantification, quality control, normalization, hierarchical
    statistical testing at cell and replicate level, effect size
    estimation, logistic regression for discriminability analysis, and
    generation of structured diagnostic reports. Includes an interactive
    'shiny' application for guided analysis, result exploration, and
    report export.
